# Packages installed into the MaluOS Desktop root filesystem, on top of the
# Ubuntu bootstrap. The desktop is also a memory host (maluos-server: PostgreSQL
# 18, MaluDB, the vault, the gateway, agents) so agents on the workstation have
# local memory; the API server and the Business OS kernel stay on the office.
ubuntu-minimal
maluos-desktop
maluos-server
linux-generic
# dracut: the Ubuntu 26.04 initramfs builder. The kernel only recommends one
# and ubuntu-minimal pulls none in (ubuntu-server-minimal does).
dracut
grub-pc-bin
grub-efi-amd64-signed
shim-signed
grub2-common
efibootmgr
cloud-init
cloud-guest-utils
openssh-server
locales
tzdata
less
vim-tiny
